{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgHTX6pGSpsfKu9D2aAiY", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 8247, "cache_read_input_tokens": 22223, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 8247}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "98fa9eaa-9d21-4379-986d-992bbe819ced", "uuid": "87978aad-58e0-4c21-b037-af266f4969c1", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T14:47:14.548Z", "request_id": "req_011CgHTX6YQ6NyhwqipuaK3Y", "thinking_duration_ms": 4318, "thinking_display": "updates"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgHTX6pGSpsfKu9D2aAiY", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Run `/pstack:setup-pstack`. It sets the model for each role and saves the choices in a rules file.\n\n**How you choose**\n1. It lists the models your session can use.\n2. It asks for a reasoning budget: `unlimited` (max), `large` (xhigh), `medium` (high) or `small` (medium). `large` matches the defaults.\n3. It shows every role with its model. You accept them or change specific roles. Besides the detected models, you can pick `inherit-parent` or `auto`, which run that role on the chat's own model.\n4. It checks that each model you picked is available, then writes the file.\n\nPanel roles (arena runners, architect runners, interrogate reviewers) take a list of models, and one subagent runs per entry. `arena cross-judge pool` is also a list, but Arena picks one model from it. `swarm workers` is the default model for every swarm worker.\n\n**Where the setting lives**\n- **Claude Code:** `~/.claude/rules/pstack-models.md`. Claude Code loads it into every new session. It has no frontmatter. It has a `# budget` line and one `role: model` line per role, for example `opus xhigh`. A `grok-*` slug becomes `inherit-parent` here.\n- **Cursor:** `~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc`, with `alwaysApply: true`.\n\nYou can also edit the file by hand. Deleting a role's line puts that role back on its skill default. A new model choice only applies to new chats. Without this file, every role uses its default. I couldn't check whether the file exists for you, because my file access is limited to this session's working directory.\n\nPrompt to send:\n\n```\n/pstack:setup-pstack\n```\n\nSource: https://github.com/cursor/plugins/blob/main/pstack/skills/setup-pstack/SKILL.md. For the Claude Code file locations: https://github.com/cursor/plugins/blob/main/pstack/docs/harness/claude-code.md"}], "container": null, "sto